  "about": "What a transaction asking gas pays at a node's minimum gas prices, times a tip: in the preferred denom if priced, else uaeth, else the first priced denom; rounded up. Checked by the Go wallet (wallet/fees_test.go), the TypeScript client (test/fees.test.ts) and the Python client (tests/test_fees.py).",
